    "---\n",
    "## 📋 Summary: RAG Design Choices Cheat Sheet\n",
    "\n",
    "| Component | Options | Rule of Thumb |\n",
    "|-----------|---------|---------------|\n",
    "| **Chunking** | Fixed / Paragraph / Sentence | Start with sentence-pairs; tune chunk size empirically |\n",
    "| **Embedding** | MiniLM → MPNet → domain-tuned | MiniLM for speed; MPNet for quality |\n",
    "| **Re-ranking** | None / Cross-encoder / LLM-judge | Add cross-encoder when top-3 precision matters |\n",
    "| **Context budget** | 100-2000 tokens | 200-500 tokens for most RAG tasks |\n",
    "| **Alpha (hybrid)** | 0.3–0.9 | Default 0.7; increase for paraphrases, decrease for exact terms |\n",
    "| **Temperature** | 0.0–2.0 | 0.1-0.3 for factual Q&A; 0.7-1.0 for creative tasks |\n",
    "| **Quantisation** | None / INT8 / PQ | INT8 is free — use it in production always |"
